  {
    "hotel_id": "61211",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/sintra-hotel/hotel/macau-mo.html",
    "name": "Hotel Sintra",
    "detail": "My family and I had a wonderful stay at Sintra Hotel. It has a perfect location, various tourist attractions and casinos like Grand Lisboa and Wynn are within walking distance. The rooms are clean, spacious and comfortable. The staffs at the front desk and concierge are friendly and helpful. I had no problems with my check in. The free WIFI password was given upon check-in. I would also like to thank the Assistant Manager there who patiently shared with me everything about Macau - the attractions,transportation,things to buy, and most importantly the nice food! :) We loved the free shuttle bus as well! We took the bus from Macau Ferry Terminal to right in front of the hotel. There is also free shuttle bus to City of Dreams (from there you can also walk to the Venetian Macau and the famous street, guan ye jie). In conclusion, I highly recommend this hotel to those who are looking for a hotel in Macau with good value for money! ",
